{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liuliao-e-o063","title":"亮密指蒋琬仪怨愤形于声色","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-ccc76b54d4f2419f1a75","label":"正文","text":"亮密指蒋琬仪怨愤形于声色","evidence":["liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0045","role":"至拜为中军师无所统领从容而已、自惟年宦先琬才能逾之、怨愤形于声色叹咤之音发于五内","evidence":["liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0047","role":"亮平生密指所在、遂为尚书令益州刺史","evidence":["liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"平生密指以仪性狷狭意在蒋琬者","evidence":["liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925","source_order":[40,330,0],"order":7326}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0047","name":"蒋琬","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-p0045","name":"杨仪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-1c812a4820a869379925","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-317d1e2f3b26f8f27025","layer":"original","quote":"而亮平生密指〖12〗，以仪性狷狭〖13〗，意在蒋琬；琬遂为尚书令、益州刺史。仪至，拜为中军师，无所统领，从容而已〖14〗。初，仪为先主尚书，琬为尚书郎；后虽俱为丞相参军、长史，仪每从行，当其劳剧〖15〗。自惟年宦先琬，才能逾之；于是怨愤形于声色，叹咤之音发于五内","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":329,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
